{"3535870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bayaya", "steam_appid": 3535870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3651530], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bayaya is a story-driven fairytale adventure with relaxing life-sim elements. Explore a handcrafted wooden-toy world, help villagers through honest work, and follow the journey of Prince Bayaya as he leaves the castle to find his own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood, tend gardens, carry logs, help farmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/8270d03b4f5b98dbf25de234321d1f0c.poster.avif?t=1785946238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/8270d03b4f5b98dbf25de234321d1f0c.webm?t=1785946238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/8270d03b4f5b98dbf25de234321d1f0c.mp4?t=1785946238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A fairytale story about work, kindness, and courage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the Czech folk tale of Prince Bayaya. Learn from your talking horse, meet villagers, and take part in their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/3d06e911cea0741e8d5b221557b38d0e.poster.avif?t=1785946238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/3d06e911cea0741e8d5b221557b38d0e.webm?t=1785946238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/3d06e911cea0741e8d5b221557b38d0e.mp4?t=1785946238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted wooden-toy aesthetic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique visual style inspired by traditional wooden toys. Soft shapes, warm colors, and a world full of small details.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/8661fd89c418eda1ade7d01066bec542.poster.avif?t=1785946238\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/8661fd89c418eda1ade7d01066bec542.webm?t=1785946238\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/8661fd89c418eda1ade7d01066bec542.mp4?t=1785946238\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A living countryside</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a lot to experience. The environment feels alive even when you simply stop and watch.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bayaya is a story-driven fairytale adventure with relaxing life-sim elements. Explore a handcrafted wooden-toy world, help villagers through honest work, and follow the journey of Prince Bayaya as he leaves the castle to find his own path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop wood, tend gardens, carry logs, help farmers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535870/extras/8270d03b4f5b98dbf25de234321d1f0c.poster.avif?t=178594623